  <item>
    <title>EP90 秋天允许枯萎的事物变得绚烂啊，厉娜</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6af2aed15b7c4709bfe3da9f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af2aed15b7c4709bfe3da9f</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 05:45:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>今天的节目会聊到：</span></h2><ol><li><p><span>一首我最近看到的关于“秋天”的一首诗</span></p></li><li><p><span>带小狗去做手术，意识到身体是革命的本钱</span></p></li><li><p><span>停止吮吸痛苦，就能获得一部分的自我解放</span></p></li><li><p><span>如何“被揪头发”也要维持好看的方法</span></p></li></ol><p></p><p><strong><span>这里是提到的那首诗（作者：Trev Cimenski）：</span></strong></p><blockquote><p><span>Autumn is all i have got - 夏天是我仅有的归属</span></p><p><span>I havn't got the body for summer - 我没有适合夏天的轻盈体态</span></p><p><span>or the mind thats needed for winter - 没有熬过寒冬所需要的坚毅精神</span></p><p><span>or even the heart that unfolds in spring - 甚至没有那颗在春天复苏绽放的心</span></p><p><span>but fall i think is where the soul clings - 那是灵魂得以气息的季节</span></p><p><span>i find it here every time looking for me - 每一次我都能在这个季节 找回自己</span></p><p><span>along with a chill that nips at the skin - 伴随着丝丝咬人的冷风</span></p><p><span>but reminds me that im warm blooded - 它也在寻找我，提醒我，我依然热血沸腾</span></p><p><span>and flooded with hot and bright color - 生命力依然流淌着滚烫而耀眼的色彩</span></p><p><span>is a season when dying things are allowed to be beautiful - 允许枯萎的事物绚烂</span></p><p><span>and living things allowed to be ugly - 允许鲜活的事物狼狈</span></p><p><span>and everything allowed to be still - 也允许万事万物放慢脚步</span></p><p><span>autumn gives the permission - 秋天给了我们权利</span></p></blockquote><p></p><h2><span>主播介绍</span></h2><p><span>马特：最近在学网球的一男的</span></p><h2><span>背景音乐</span></h2><p><span>时空储蓄罐 - Decorate</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/603e09e7b3814560cb2e015c/lq-xO2pyC47VYgHrBaZdtzf-2AAQ.m4a" length="25067357" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:25:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuGpydGmkFRABTpIq18my29M8_X2.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
